                    <span>Check if another app is using the camera</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-2">
                    <span class="text-muted-foreground/60">•</span>
                    <span>Ensure camera is not covered or disabled</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-2">
                    <span class="text-muted-foreground/60">•</span>
                    <span>Update your browser to the latest version</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-2">
                    <span class="text-muted-foreground/60">•</span>
                    <span>Try a different browser to isolate the issue</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
